BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bracelet Making Workshop with Rebecca Baird
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T150000
UID:bracelet-making-workshop-rebecca-baird@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Bracelet Making Workshop with Rebecca Baird\n\nBracelet Making
  Workshop with Rebecca Baird Friday\, November 20\, 2026\, 12:00 p.m. to 3
 :00 p.m. Onsite Gallery\, 199 Richmond Street West\, Toronto Join exhibiti
 on artist Rebecca Baird for an inspiring\, hands-on jewellery-making works
 hop where creativity and craftsmanship come together. In this immersive th
 ree-hour session\, participants will learn the fundamentals of bracelet de
 sign while creating a one-of-a-kind piece from start to finish. Perfect fo
 r beginners and anyone looking to explore a new creative skill\, Rebecca w
 ill provide step-by-step instruction on essential jewellery-making techniq
 ues\, including selecting materials\, assembling components\, and achievin
 g a polished finish. Throughout the workshop\, participants will receive p
 ersonalized guidance in a welcoming and supportive environment\, with plen
 ty of time to experiment\, ask questions\, and work at their own pace. Whe
 ther you're interested in discovering a new hobby\, creating a meaningful 
 handmade gift\, or simply spending an afternoon making art\, this workshop
  offers a rewarding creative experience. By the end of the session\, you'l
 l leave with a beautifully handcrafted bracelet\, newfound jewellery-makin
 g skills\, and the confidence to continue exploring your own creative prac
 tice. Space is limited. Please email to register to susanjama@ocadu.ca
LOCATION:Onsite Gallery (RHD) 199 Richmond Street West 199 Richmond Street
  West
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/bracelet-making-workshop-r
 ebecca-baird
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
